Well, that and sometimes, Ed, sometimes you just got to do something bad just to know you're alive.

00:39:25.130 --> 00:39:28.620
I've got to hand it to you, Barbara. You got quite a wall up there. How's the hand?

00:39:29.340 --> 00:39:29.600
Better.

00:39:31.340 --> 00:39:32.360
Good job on the uniform.

00:39:33.080 --> 00:39:34.360
Oh, that's nothing.

