00:39:37.720 --> 00:39:39.560
witness what our little community likes to call

00:39:39.560 --> 00:39:40.560
the running of the bulls?

00:39:40.870 --> 00:39:41.590
I don't think so.

00:39:41.950 --> 00:39:43.530
Oh, no impropriety implied.

00:39:43.550 --> 00:39:46.590
There's a guest room upstairs, lots of privacy,

00:39:46.830 --> 00:39:47.610
lock on the door.

00:39:48.800 --> 00:39:49.820
I'm expected back.

00:39:51.710 --> 00:39:52.090
Husband?

00:39:52.990 --> 00:39:53.170
No.

00:39:54.500 --> 00:39:54.960
Boyfriend?

00:39:56.270 --> 00:39:57.890
Two Blackpoint German shepherds

00:39:57.890 --> 00:39:59.310
that'll eat the stuffing out of the couch

00:39:59.310 --> 00:39:59.970
if I don't get back.

00:40:00.030 --> 00:40:08.740
there and put out some kibble nice dog shepherds listen there's this uh little dinner theater down

00:40:08.740 --> 00:40:15.760
your way it's a cozy little place got a nice wine cellar decontini's yeah that's the place yeah we

00:40:15.760 --> 00:40:23.250
had their liquor license on a six-month suspension last year serving miners without id uh-huh uh well

00:40:23.250 --> 00:40:28.360
what i was getting at is i thought next time i was down your way i could take you there we could

00:40:28.360 --> 00:40:29.760
daughter up nice Delmonico

00:40:30.000 --> 00:40:41.400
catch the show if we locate your property i'll be in touch uh barbara look what i'm trying to say

00:40:41.400 --> 00:40:48.560
is that i would like to see you again on a non-professional basis let me give it to you

00:40:48.560 --> 00:40:59.980
straight i could never respect a man who did my ironing no no no that wasn't me that wasn't

00:41:00.000 --> 00:41:01.960
the real me. It was that damn ice thing.

00:41:02.900 --> 00:41:04.700
Look, I'm not a panty-waste

00:41:04.700 --> 00:41:06.540
new man. I had 15

00:41:06.540 --> 00:41:08.520
confirmed kills over Pusan.

00:41:12.720 --> 00:41:14.480
What I'm trying to say, Barbara, is

00:41:14.480 --> 00:41:18.040
that I feel a great

00:41:18.480 --> 00:41:21.840
affection, a great respect,

00:41:23.480 --> 00:41:24.400
admiration, and

00:41:24.400 --> 00:41:29.170
attraction toward you. I gotta get going.

00:41:35.530 --> 00:41:36.210
Lock those windows.

00:41:49.560 --> 00:41:50.840
Listen, I got to talk to you.

00:41:51.640 --> 00:41:52.520
Barge right in, Flaggman.

00:41:52.640 --> 00:41:53.060
Is he here?

00:41:53.480 --> 00:41:54.540
No, no, no, he's not here.

00:41:54.950 --> 00:41:55.410
Okay, look.

00:41:55.790 --> 00:41:56.430
Can I have this?

00:41:57.560 --> 00:41:58.020
Help yourself.

00:41:59.740 --> 00:41:59.880
Okay.

00:42:00.540 --> 00:42:03.850
Look, certain things were put in motion last night, and I'm not laying blame.

00:42:04.010 --> 00:42:07.300
We've been through this before about who started what and who did what to whom,

00:42:07.320 --> 00:42:09.520
and I agree, it was an accident, but it's got to stop.

00:42:09.860 --> 00:42:11.360
It's interfering with my life.

00:42:11.480 --> 00:42:11.860
What is?

00:42:12.280 --> 00:42:14.380
You. I can't stop thinking about you.

00:42:14.580 --> 00:42:20.380
I mean, it's not you per se, but your body, your neck, your shoulders, sex.

00:42:20.700 --> 00:42:22.580
I keep seeing that look in your face.

00:42:22.880 --> 00:42:25.520
The one when we were in the kitchen, we were bouncing off the walls.

00:42:25.940 --> 00:42:28.280
I'm with a patient. I see your thigh.

00:42:28.840 --> 00:42:29.920
I'm driving to work.

00:42:30.030 --> 00:42:31.250
I want your toes in my mouth.

00:42:31.690 --> 00:42:33.410
You told me it was gonna stop when the ice broke.

00:42:33.510 --> 00:42:34.370
Well, they're supposed to.

00:42:34.650 --> 00:42:35.110
You're great.

00:42:35.290 --> 00:42:36.610
Look, Flashman, you're not the only one.

00:42:36.690 --> 00:42:38.130
I'm not even safe in my own bedroom anymore.

00:42:38.190 --> 00:42:39.990
You've invaded my dreams.

00:42:40.210 --> 00:42:40.390
Yeah?

00:42:40.610 --> 00:42:40.930
Yeah.

00:42:41.290 --> 00:42:44.170
I mean, we're in the kitchen, but only this time so we can't control ourselves.

00:42:44.450 --> 00:42:46.930
I'm ripping your clothes off, and you're taking my clothes off.

00:42:46.990 --> 00:42:47.190
Really?

00:42:47.330 --> 00:42:49.730
And you got me up against the wall, and you just keep going.

00:42:49.810 --> 00:42:50.570
And I want it.

00:42:50.710 --> 00:42:51.870
And I'm begging for it.

00:42:51.950 --> 00:42:54.010
And you keep on going and going and going until...

00:42:54.010 --> 00:42:54.150
Yeah.

00:42:54.250 --> 00:42:55.930
I mean, you just go on and on and on until...

00:42:55.930 --> 00:42:56.070
Yeah.

00:42:56.310 --> 00:42:56.630
Until...

00:42:56.630 --> 00:42:57.070
Yeah, yeah.

00:42:57.070 --> 00:42:57.670
Yeah, I do.

00:42:57.810 --> 00:42:58.190
I do.

00:42:58.310 --> 00:42:58.690
I do.

00:43:01.080 --> 00:43:09.480
I guess we cleared the air.

00:43:09.810 --> 00:43:12.190
Yeah, that was good. That was helpful.

00:43:22.940 --> 00:43:24.480
Smoke? You hate smoking.

00:43:25.080 --> 00:43:27.080
You always get on to me when I light up.

00:43:27.200 --> 00:43:28.020
I smoke sometimes.

00:43:30.000 --> 00:43:31.400
after a good conversation.

00:43:39.610 --> 00:43:40.050
Warren.

00:43:42.460 --> 00:43:43.340
Hey, everybody.

00:43:44.560 --> 00:43:46.120
Hey, Holly.

00:43:46.340 --> 00:43:47.260
How you doing, Joel?

00:43:47.480 --> 00:43:48.180
Okay, how you doing?

00:43:48.960 --> 00:43:49.340
Maurice?

00:43:49.660 --> 00:43:53.320
Joel, you ready for your first running of the bulls?

00:43:53.720 --> 00:43:55.040
Yeah, I did the New York City Marathon.

00:43:55.060 --> 00:43:57.380
I got all the way to Greenpoint Avenue before I passed out.

00:43:58.370 --> 00:43:59.970
Well, gentlemen, that's...

