In this particular race, the men of Sicily run in the buff.

00:44:34.610 --> 00:44:34.770
No.

00:44:35.460 --> 00:44:36.640
Sicilian tradition, Joel.

00:44:37.920 --> 00:44:41.760
You're going to run out that door, down Main Street, out to Highway 1,

00:44:41.780 --> 00:44:46.700
