00:44:47.340 --> 00:44:48.320
That's right.

00:44:49.860 --> 00:44:50.240
No.

00:44:51.290 --> 00:44:53.230
Warms up once you get going, right, fellas?

00:45:00.700 --> 00:45:00.920
Woohoo!

